ainer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Brief Introduction of\u00a0<\/strong>Needle Punched Felt Filter Cloth<\/h2><p>\u201cNeedle-punched felt\u201d is a fine fiber cloth with interlaced fibers and evenly distributed voids produced by non-woven needle-punched technology. It is mainly produced from polyester staple fibers and polyester twisted yarns. After hot rolling, singeing or coating, the surface of the needle felt is flat and smooth, and it is not easy to be blocked by dust.<\/p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Advantages of Needle Punched Felt Filter Cloth<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><strong>High-efficiency filtration<\/strong>: Needle-punched filter felt has a high filtration efficiency and can effectively capture tiny particles and solid particles, making it widely used in industrial filtration systems.<\/li><li><strong>Wear resistance<\/strong>: This filter material generally has good wear resistance and can work under high flow rates and high pressures, reducing the frequency of replacing filter materials.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical resistance<\/strong>: It can choose chemically inert materials as needed, allowing it to work in corrosive environments, such as in the chemical industry.<\/li><li><strong>Strong adaptability<\/strong>: It can be customized according to different needs, including different fiber materials, thicknesses and pore sizes, to adapt to the filtration requirements in different fields.<\/li><li><strong>Easy to clean and replace<\/strong>: Compared to disposable filter materials, needle-punched filter felts can usually be cleaned and reused, or replaced relatively easily, which helps reduce maintenance costs.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Specifications<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><strong>Application<\/strong>: Air filtration (dust filtration), water filtration (liquid filtration: 1-100\u03bcm).<\/li><li><strong>Material<\/strong>: Polypropylene (PP), acrylic, polyester (PE), PPS, aramid (Aramid), P84, PTFE, fiberglass, FMS.<\/li><li><strong>Processing<\/strong>: Calendering, heat setting, singeing, anti-static, water&amp;oil repellent, PTFE membrane.<\/li><li><strong>Shape<\/strong>: Roll (diameter: 120-180mm; length: 2000-9000mm; or customized).<\/li><li><strong>Thickness<\/strong>: 0.5 \u2013 30mm or customized..<\/li><li><strong>Width<\/strong>: \u2264320 cm.<\/li><li><strong>Gram Weight<\/strong>: 300~600g.<\/li><\/ul><div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-light\"><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\u00a0<\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb705af e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fb705af\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c648af elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1c648af\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Material For Needle Punched Felt Filter Cloth<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95a7184 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"95a7184\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a5c4f8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4a5c4f8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2727\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PP-p2_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PP-p2_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PP-p2_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PP-p2_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PP-p2_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=polypropylene-needle-felt-filter-cloth\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/best-filter.com\/product\/polypropylene-needle-felt\/\">Polypropylene Needle Felt<\/a><\/strong><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264170\u2103)<\/p><p>Polypropylene filter needle felt is a specific type of needle felt commonly used in industrial filtration applications. It is a non-woven fabric made by mechanically needling polypropylene fibers, which has good filtration performance and durability. This type of needle felt is mainly used for the filtration and separation of solid particles, liquids or gases.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a0603cf elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a0603cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2729\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Polyester-Needle-Punched-Felt-p4_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Polyester-Needle-Punched-Felt-p4_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Polyester-Needle-Punched-Felt-p4_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Polyester-Needle-Punched-Felt-p4_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Polyester-Needle-Punched-Felt-p4_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=polyester-needle-felt-filter-cloth\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/best-filter.com\/product\/polyester-pe-needle-punched-felt\/\"><strong>Polyester Needle Punched Felt<\/strong><\/a><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264130\u2103)<\/p><p>The filter material has the advantages of high strength, good elasticity, dimensional stability, good wear resistance, large void ratio, good air permeability, long service life, good dust removal effect, etc. It has good mechanical properties, acidity resistance, and alkali resistance at room temperature. temperature and durability.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57014f7 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"57014f7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2728\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Acrylic-Needle-Punched-Felt-p3_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Acrylic-Needle-Punched-Felt-p3_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Acrylic-Needle-Punched-Felt-p3_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Acrylic-Needle-Punched-Felt-p3_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Acrylic-Needle-Punched-Felt-p3_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=acrylic-needle-felt-filter-cloth\"><strong>Acrylic Needle Punched Felt<\/strong><\/a><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264130\u2103)<\/p><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Acrylic needle felt is a kind of fine fiber cloth using non-woven needle punching technology. The acrylic fibers are arranged in a staggered manner, the gaps are evenly distributed and large, the air permeability is good, and the chemical resistance is stable.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2b6a42 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e2b6a42\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2754\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Aramid-Needle-Punched-Felt-p5_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Aramid-Needle-Punched-Felt-p5_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Aramid-Needle-Punched-Felt-p5_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Aramid-Needle-Punched-Felt-p5_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-Aramid-Needle-Punched-Felt-p5_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=nomex-needle-felt-filter-cloth\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/best-filter.com\/product\/nomex-aramid-needle-punched-felt\/\"><strong>Aramid Needle Punched Felt<\/strong><\/a><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264200\u2103)<\/p><p>Aramid (poly-p-phenylene terephthalamide) fiber is a new type of high-tech synthetic fiber with excellent properties such as ultra-high strength, high modulus, high temperature resistance, acid and alkali resistance, and light weight.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5adeca elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e5adeca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2755\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-P84-p6_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-P84-p6_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-P84-p6_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-P84-p6_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-P84-p6_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=p84-needle-felt-filter-cloth\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/best-filter.com\/product\/p84-needle-felt\/\"><strong>P84 Needle Felt<\/strong><\/a><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264240\u2103)<\/p><p>P84 needle punched felt is one of the most common materials used to make filter bags. And has high temperature resistance, good corrosion resistance and acid resistance. P84 needle felt provides a unique and cost-effective solution for many demanding industrial baghouse applications.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-348b886 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"348b886\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2756\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PPS-p7_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PPS-p7_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PPS-p7_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PPS-p7_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PPS-p7_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=pps-needle-felt-filter-cloth\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/best-filter.com\/product\/pps-needle-felt\/\"><strong>PPS(Ryton) Needle Felt<\/strong><\/a><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264190\u2103)<\/p><p>PPS is a special synthetic polymer that can maintain stability under high temperature and chemical corrosion conditions, so it is often used in flue gas purification and high temperature gas filtration in industrial fields.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7882f55 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7882f55\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2757\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PTFE-p8_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PTFE-p8_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PTFE-p8_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PTFE-p8_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-PTFE-p8_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=ptfe-needle-felt-filter-cloth\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/best-filter.com\/product\/ptfe-needle-felt\/\"><strong>PTFE Needle Felt<\/strong><\/a><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264250\u2103)<\/p><p>PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene) filter felt is a polymer material with excellent chemical resistance, high temperature resistance and low friction coefficient. It is used in many industrial applications requiring high temperature, corrosive gas or liquid filtration. It is one of the most common materials used to make filter bags.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7be2f46 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7be2f46\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2758\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-Fiberglass-pure-p9_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-Fiberglass-pure-p9_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-Fiberglass-pure-p9_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-Fiberglass-pure-p9_syy-100x100.jpg 100w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Needle-felt-Fiberglass-pure-p9_syy.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p><h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=fiberglass-needle-felt-filter-cloth\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/best-filter.com\/product\/fiberglass-needle-felt\/\"><strong>Fiberglass Needle Felt<\/strong><\/a><\/h6><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">(Working Temperature: \u2264230\u2103)<\/p><p>Fiberglass needle felt has the characteristics of dimensional stability, high tensile strength at break, corrosion resistance, smooth surface, good water repellency, good air permeability, easy cleaning, and good chemical stability.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65c06cc elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"65c06cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2759\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-FMS-Needle-Felt-p10_syy-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Filmedia-FMS-Needle-Felt-p10_syy-300x